<!-- Pacific Strike CIA memorandum event, adapted from Strike Group Molniya U.S.-voice interstitial format. -->
<Page
  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
  xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
  xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
  mc:Ignorable="d"
  d:DesignWidth="1920"
  d:DesignHeight="1080">
  <Viewbox>
    <Border Background="White" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Width="864" Height="1120" Padding="45"
            TextElement.FontFamily="Courier New" TextElement.Foreground="Black" TextElement.FontSize="16">
      <Border.Effect>
        <DropShadowEffect />
      </Border.Effect>

      <Border BorderThickness="0,10,10,10" BorderBrush="#FF000000">
        <Grid>
          <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
          </Grid.RowDefinitions>
          <TextBlock Text="C05084534" Background="#FFFFFFFF" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="17,-15,0,0" Padding="5,0,5,0" />
          <Grid Grid.Row="0">
            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
              <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
              <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
              <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
              <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
              <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
              <RowDefinition Height="15"/>
              <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
              <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
              <RowDefinition Height="15"/>
              <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            </Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
              <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
              <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
              <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" Text="TOP SECRET" TextAlignment="Center"/>
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" Grid.RowSpan="2" TextAlignment="Center" FontFamily="Times New Roman">
              Main Intelligence Directorate
              <LineBreak/>
              <LineBreak/>
              <Run FontSize="12">Moscow, 62665</Run>
            </TextBlock>
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="3" Text="17 Febuary 1988"/>
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="6" Grid.Column="3" Text="222X1"/>
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="0" Text="MEMORANDUM FOR:   "/>
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="1" TextWrapping="Wrap">
              VMF HIGH COMMAND
              <LineBreak/>
              RED BANNER PACIFIC FLEET
              <LineBreak/>
              10th OPERATIONAL SQN//J2//
              <LineBreak/>
              55th NAVAL INFANTRY DIV//J2//
            </TextBlock>
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="3" TextWrapping="Wrap">
              EO 13526 3.3(b)(1)&gt;25Yrs
              <LineBreak/>
              EO 13526 3.5(c)
            </TextBlock>
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="9" Grid.Column="0" Text="SUBJECT:   "/>
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="9" Grid.Column="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="3" Text="Japanese Comms Traffic Following Misawa Raid"/>
          </Grid>
          <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" TextWrapping="Wrap">
            1. SIGINT station VARYAG has passed Japanese command comms reporting neutralization of Misawa Air Base. The traffic reflects urgent concern that Hokkaido now lacks fighter air cover and close air support. 
            <LineBreak/>
            <LineBreak/>
            2. JMSDF and JGSDF channels direct Hokkaido commanders to hold Hokkaido at all costs. Requests include additional mobile SAM systems, missile reloads, and artillery ammunition. USN carrier airpower is requested for additional air cover and ground support. 
            <LineBreak/>
            <LineBreak/>
            3. Expect the enemy to compensate by repositioning carriers north regardless of air threat or additional SAM batteries dispersed around expected landing areas. 
            <LineBreak/>
            <LineBreak/>
			4. Japanese and American commanders appear to understand that Hokkaido and Northern Japan is now exposed. Given this, we assess conditions are favourable for immediate execution of planned landing operation. 
            <LineBreak/>
            <LineBreak/>
          </TextBlock>
          <TextBlock TextAlignment="Right" Text="Vladlen Mikhailov, Director" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="480,500,0,0" Grid.Row="2"/>
          <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.RowSpan="3" VerticalAlignment="Bottom">
            <Run TextDecorations="Underline">Distribution by ER/21 FEB 1988 w/Att</Run>
            <LineBreak/>
            <LineBreak/>
            Orig - Each Addressee
            <LineBreak/>
               1 - 2nd Directorate GRU
            <LineBreak/>
               1 - 6th Directorate GRU
            <LineBreak/>
               1 - 12th Directorate GRU
          </TextBlock>
          <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Text="TOP SECRET" TextAlignment="Center"/>
        </Grid>
      </Border>
    </Border>
  </Viewbox>
</Page>
